{"id": "pub_title:7174b5e056db0d25", "title": "Emergence Of Fermi-liquid And Bcs Physics In Overdoped Cuprates", "authors": ["B. J. Ramshaw", "Steven A. Kivelson"], "abstract": "<p>Nature Reviews Physics, Published online: 16 July 2026; <a href=\"[URL] observed behaviours of overdoped cuprates are inconsistent with a weak-coupling, Fermi-liquid-based Bardeen–Cooper–Schrieffer description. This Perspective argues that these behaviours are consequences of substitutional disorder in a d-wave superconductor with a short-correlation length, and that a weak-coupling approach is possible in the disorder-free limit.", "link": "https://www.nature.com/articles/s42254-026-00960-7", "published_date": "2026-07-16T00:00:00", "source": "nature", "source_display_name": "Nat. Rev. Phys.", "source_color": "#80CBC4", "feed_name": "Nature Reviews Physics", "tags": [], "rss_fetch_date": "2026-07-26T05:34:46.851668", "score": 0.0, "recommended": false, "direction": "", "tldr": "Analysis failed: Error code: 400 - {'error': {'message': 'The suppo", "motivation": "", "method": "", "result": "", "conclusion": "", "keywords": [], "analysis_timestamp": "2026-07-26T05:37:29.314416", "deep_read": null, "pipeline_run": "2026-07-26T06:30:58.939489"}
